join Barb center
Lizzy: I have proof!
Barb: This is going to be good.
label Journal Select
do MenuManager.open_journal()
[wait_input]
if {is_success} == true:
	do MinegameTest.update_background("strikes_number")
	if {current_item} == "b_clown_school":
		Lizzy: I know that you got accepted into Emmerdale's early admissions!
		Barb: Well, that isn't hard to guess.
		Lizzy: For the Clown Program.
		Barb: Wait, how would you—
		Barb: I haven't told anyone that yet.
		Lizzy: You want to be a movie monster.
		Barb: Okay... that's a bit specific...
	elif {current_item} == "sewing_kit":
		Lizzy: I brought this with me to fix your dress.
		Barb: There's nothing wrong with my dress. It's perfect.
		Lizzy: For now.
		Lizzy: As soon as you try to put it on it's gonna rip apart like tissue paper.
		Barb: Um, that's a bit rude.
		Lizzy: The allowance is all messed up, but I bet you one million dollars that with a few self adjustments your dress will fit like a glove.
		Lizzy: Which is why I'm giving you this.
		Barb: ...
		Lizzy: Use the floppy ruler—
		Barb: I know how to use a sewing kit, okay? Stop hovering.
		Barb: ...
		Barb: What the... You're right. It's off by a few inches.
		Barb: I gave them specific measurements.
		Barb: What the hell?!
	elif {current_item} == "b_camp_story":
		Lizzy: You got lost in the woods for three days at Little Oaks Summer Camp when you were six.
		Barb: What-
		Barb: How did you know that?
		Lizzy: You told me yourself.
		Lizzy: It was a very touching moment.
		Barb: Why would I ever tell you that?
		Lizzy: I was going to go do something dangerous and you advised me against it.
		Lizzy: You ate a pinecone and a poisonous bug.
		Lizzy: All to show up that bitch from cabin five.
		Lizzy: Your words, not mine.
		Barb: ...
		Barb: She was a bitch.
	set {strikes_number} += 1.0
else:
	Barb: And this is supposed to mean something to me because....?
	Lizzy: Uh... I was just testing to see if you're paying attention.
	[V.O] I'll have to try something else.
set {is_success} = false
if {strikes_number} < 3.0:
	jump Journal Select
Barb: A time loop? Figures.
Barb: There always has to be something crazy happening.
Lizzy: So, does that mean you believe me?
Barb: I guess so.
Barb: Thanks for saving my dress.
Barb: I didn't think you care about that sort of thing.
Lizzy: I'm multi-faceted.
[end_timeline]